        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Stir the soured cream in off the heat or over a very gentle flame. High heat will cause it to split and the sauce will look curdled." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
